{"unit_id":"TCY07__dsh-dont-stop#card-zh","repo":"TCY07/dsh-dont-stop","commit":"e0c1d39a4c3beb980d25e5ac0c749df50d30003f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Dont-Stop 是面向 DSH Web 和 Desktop 客户端的持续工作监督插件。它通过 /dont-stop 命令为 agent 设置时长或具体时刻的截止时间，并在 agent 提前结束一轮时安排后续轮次，推动其检查遗留工作并继续推进。插件还提供按错误类别等待后自动恢复、提问等待限时、截止时收尾和可选的系统保持唤醒；可用 dont_stop_wait 工具声明正在等待外部事项。设置页可调整恢复、停止、提示间隔、提问时限和唤醒模式。适合希望长时间运行 DSH 工作流并减少任务中断的用户；不需要额外账号或 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:19-20","core/index.js:831-850","core/index.js:215-228","retry/index.js:49-60","client.js:2-9"]}
{"unit_id":"TCY07__dsh-dont-stop#card-en","repo":"TCY07/dsh-dont-stop","commit":"e0c1d39a4c3beb980d25e5ac0c749df50d30003f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Dont-Stop supervises DSH work until a deadline. Use /dont-stop with a duration or clock time; it nudges the agent to continue after a turn and can recover from eligible errors. It limits question waits and can keep the host awake during supervision. No separate account or API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:19-20","core/index.js:831-850","core/index.js:215-228","retry/index.js:49-60","client.js:2-9"]}
{"unit_id":"TCY07__dsh-dont-stop#intent-1","repo":"TCY07/dsh-dont-stop","commit":"e0c1d39a4c3beb980d25e5ac0c749df50d30003f","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"想给 DSH 里的 agent 设个时间，让它提前做完后自己继续推进。","source":"generated","evidence":["core/index.js:831-850"]}
{"unit_id":"TCY07__dsh-dont-stop#intent-2","repo":"TCY07/dsh-dont-stop","commit":"e0c1d39a4c3beb980d25e5ac0c749df50d30003f","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"有没有办法让长时间运行的 DSH 任务到点才结束？","source":"generated","evidence":["core/index.js:831-850"]}
{"unit_id":"TCY07__dsh-dont-stop#intent-3","repo":"TCY07/dsh-dont-stop","commit":"e0c1d39a4c3beb980d25e5ac0c749df50d30003f","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"网络或模型服务报错后，希望 agent 等一会儿能自动接着工作。","source":"generated","evidence":["retry/index.js:49-60"]}
{"unit_id":"TCY07__dsh-dont-stop#intent-4","repo":"TCY07/dsh-dont-stop","commit":"e0c1d39a4c3beb980d25e5ac0c749df50d30003f","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 的 agent 总卡在等我回答问题，能不能超时后自行决定？","source":"generated","evidence":["core/index.js:2-10","core/settings.js:12-20"]}
{"unit_id":"TCY07__dsh-dont-stop#intent-5","repo":"TCY07/dsh-dont-stop","commit":"e0c1d39a4c3beb980d25e5ac0c749df50d30003f","type":"intent","lang":"en","text":"Keep a long-running DSH task moving after the agent finishes a round early.","source":"generated","evidence":["core/index.js:831-850"]}
{"unit_id":"TCY07__dsh-dont-stop#intent-6","repo":"TCY07/dsh-dont-stop","commit":"e0c1d39a4c3beb980d25e5ac0c749df50d30003f","type":"intent","lang":"en","text":"Can failed DSH work resume automatically after a network or provider error?","source":"generated","evidence":["retry/index.js:49-60"]}
{"unit_id":"TCY07__dsh-dont-stop#feature-1","repo":"TCY07/dsh-dont-stop","commit":"e0c1d39a4c3beb980d25e5ac0c749df50d30003f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Dont-Stop 的功能「按截止时间持续监督」：使用 /dont-stop 加时长或目标时刻启动监督，agent 每轮结束后会按计划续推，直到期限到达；命令也可附带初始任务指令。","source":"generated","evidence":["core/index.js:831-850","core/index.js:177-190"]}
{"unit_id":"TCY07__dsh-dont-stop#feature-2","repo":"TCY07/dsh-dont-stop","commit":"e0c1d39a4c3beb980d25e5ac0c749df50d30003f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Dont-Stop 的功能「错误后自动恢复」：顶层 agent 遇到可分类恢复的回合错误后，插件按错误类别等待并安排恢复；用户可在恢复等待时立即重试或取消。","source":"generated","evidence":["retry/index.js:49-60","retry/index.js:175-205"]}
{"unit_id":"TCY07__dsh-dont-stop#feature-3","repo":"TCY07/dsh-dont-stop","commit":"e0c1d39a4c3beb980d25e5ac0c749df50d30003f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Dont-Stop 的功能「提问等待限时」：在监督期间，或启用始终限时设置时，等待用户回答的问题到达时限后会关闭等待并提示 agent 自行决定，避免工作停在提问环节。","source":"generated","evidence":["core/index.js:2-10","core/settings.js:12-20"]}
{"unit_id":"TCY07__dsh-dont-stop#feature-4","repo":"TCY07/dsh-dont-stop","commit":"e0c1d39a4c3beb980d25e5ac0c749df50d30003f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Dont-Stop 的功能「监督期间保持唤醒」：启用相应设置后，插件根据宿主和操作系统使用可用的保持唤醒方式，并在监督结束时释放保持状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:31-47","power/index.js:1-15"]}
{"unit_id":"TCY07__dsh-dont-stop#caveat-1","repo":"TCY07/dsh-dont-stop","commit":"e0c1d39a4c3beb980d25e5ac0c749df50d30003f","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Dont-Stop 使用前须知：插件设置保存在 DSH_HOME 指向的目录下；未设置时写入用户目录中的 .dsh/storages/dont-stop/settings.json。","source":"generated","evidence":["core/settings.js:12-20","core/settings.js:35-39"]}
